          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "长满结晶的大脑么，很难下嘴啊……",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n12:continue"
        }
      },
      "n13": {
        "id": "n13",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "你说我吗？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n13:continue"
        }
      },
      "n14": {
        "id": "n14",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "说的火锅，刚才我联想到了上次咱们去火锅店吃的猪脑。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n14:continue"
        }
      },
      "n15": {
        "id": "n15",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "player",
          "text": "没抽到我想要的，要不还是氪一下。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n15:continue"
        }
      },
      "n16": {
        "id": "n16",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "充钱就像上供，只能得到保底作为神的恩赐，无法买到你心爱的那张卡……我是说游戏之神。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:n16:continue"
        }
      },
